# BigSuno Unified Platform (YouTube-Style) - Detailed PRD

## 1. Core Philosophy
BigSuno is a unified "Creator" platform. Like YouTube, anyone can login and browse. Users can choose to become "Providers" (Mentors, Listeners, Influencers) through a dedicated "Smart Earning" flow.

## 2. User Journey & Onboarding

### 2.1 The "Guest to Seeker" Flow
- **Login**: User logs in (Google/Phone). 
- **Direct Entry**: No upfront onboarding. User lands directly on the **Home** page.
- **Browsing**: User can see banners, headers, and categories.

### 2.2 The "Seeker to Provider" (Smart Earning) Flow
- **Trigger**: User clicks "Start Earning" on the **Me** page.
- **Education**: 5-slide Introduction (Showcases how to earn, rules, and benefits).
- **Registration Form**:
  - Name (Required)
  - DP (User upload or Admin default avatars)
  - Age & Gender
  - Mobile Number
- **Result**: User is now a "Provider" and their full profile is visible on the "Me" page and Home feed.

## 3. Page Specifications

### 3.1 Home Page (`/home`)
- **Top**: Dynamic Banner & Search Header.
- **Categories** (Tabs/Buttons below Banner):
  | Category | Description |
  | :--- | :--- |
  | **All** | Default mixed view of all Providers |
  | **Influencer** | Social media stars / specialized personalities |
  | **Mentor/Coach** | Guidance, career, and life advice experts |
  | **Listener** | Empathetic listeners for emotional support |
- **Feed**: Unified Provider Cards. Clicking a card opens the **Public Profile**.

### 3.2 Public Profile Page (`/p/[uid]`)
- **Header**: Banner, DP, Name, Headline.
- **Content**: Detailed Description, User Reviews.
- **Plans**: 3 distinct price plans (e.g. 5 min, 15 min, 30 min).
- **Action**: Clicking a plan triggers the **Call Setup**.

### 3.3 Call History Page (`/history`)
Two distinct sections/tabs:
- **Incoming**: Calls you received as a Provider (Someone paid for your plan).
- **Outgoing**: Calls you made to other Providers (Outbound calls).

### 3.4 Wallet Page (`/wallet`)
- **Stats**: Total Earnings (All time), Available Amount (Pending/Not yet withdrawn).
- **Add Money**: Sliding modal to enter amount (e.g., 300).
- **Hybrid Payment during Call**:
  - If Wallet (300) < Plan (500), show PayU slide for 200.
  - Total (500) is held for the call.
- **Transactions**: Detailed list with status (Pending, Requested, Completed, Rejected).

### 3.5 "Me" Page (`/me`)
- **Header**: Basic User Info.
- **Standard Controls**: Sign Out, Helpline.
- **Provider Dashboard (If Registered)**:
  - Full Profile View: Banner, DP, Name, Headline, Description, 3 Plans.
  - **Online/Offline Toggle**: Switch visibility on/off for the Home page.
  - **Edit Profile**: Update bio/headlines.
  - **Edit Plans**: Change prices/durations.
  - **Delete Account**: Warning popup -> Confirmation -> Permanent Deletion.

## 4. Business & Technical Logic

### 4.1 Payment & Commission
- **Rate**: 10% Platform Commission.
- **Earning Calculation**: [Plan Price] - [10% Commission] = [Provider Earning].
- **Timing**: Funds move to "Available" only after successful call completion.

### 4.2 Refund Rules
- **Caller (Seeker) Hangs Up**: Payment is final (Provider gets paid).
- **Receiver (Provider) Hangs Up**: Caller is refunded (Provider gets zero).
- **Auto-Cut/Connection Loss**: Money goes to the Provider (handled as success).

### 4.3 Withdrawal Workflow
- **Batching**: When a user requests withdrawal, **ALL** transactions in "Pending" status are summed and moved to "Requested".
- **Admin Role**:
  - Approved: Transaction status -> "Completed".
  - Rejected: Transaction status -> "Pending" (with a Mandatory "Reason").
- **History**: User sees "Request = Completed/Rejected" in their transaction trail.

## 5. Directory Structure (Refined)
- `/src/app/home` (Unified Feed)
- `/src/app/history` (Incoming/Outgoing)
- `/src/app/wallet` (Add Money / Payouts)
- `/src/app/me` (Profile / Start Earning / Online Switch)
- `/src/app/p/[id]` (Public Profile)
- `/src/app/call/[id]` (Active Call Interface)
- `/src/app/onboarding/provider` (Smart Earning Flow)
